    "title": "The symmetric MMP mouth clock is not an independent boundary mode",
    "doi": "10.5281/zenodo.23323433",
    "publication_date": "2026-10-12",
    "description": "<p>In the fixed-flux spherical sector of the Maldacena-Milekhin-Popov wormhole, the symmetric proper-mouth clock is not an independent boundary mode once both asymptotic clocks are normalized. The classification is already known. This deposit records that obstruction and does not claim a new theorem.</p><p>No shortcut, formation, propulsion, occupancy, TRL, launch, seed, or revenue result is claimed. No Lean certificate is claimed.</p><p>Author: Daniel Eric Fredriksen, Quantyra Inc. Manuscript and source bundle: CC-BY-4.0. Version 0.1.0.</p>",
